  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Space, quality and convenience come together beautifully at 2B Rangitoto Terrace.\r\n\r\nAs one of the largest residences within the development, this brand-new home provides generous living and entertaining areas for growing or extended families. A private lift offers effortless access across all levels, while sea views add a special coastal dimension to everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe flexible floor plan features four generous bedrooms, three stylish bathrooms and two master suites with ensuites-ideal for multi-generational living, teenagers, guests or those wanting greater privacy within the home.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n\r\n*  One of the largest layouts in the development\r\n*  Sea views\r\n*  Private lift servicing all levels\r\n*  Four generous bedrooms\r\n*  Three stylish bathrooms\r\n*  Two master suites with ensuites\r\n*  Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n*  Generous entertaining areas\r\n*  kitchen with quality finishes\r\n*  Internal-access garaging\r\n*  Ideal for growing or multi-generational families, future-proofed and well suited to retirement living\r\n*  Brand-new, low-maintenance construction\r\n\r\nMilford Village, its cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and boutique shopping are all within easy walking distance. You can also stroll to Milford Beach and enjoy the best of the area's sought-after seaside lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe property provides convenient access to public transport and motorway connections and is zoned for Milford Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School.\r\n\r\nOffering substantial family space, a private lift and sea views in a tightly held coastal suburb, 2B Rangitoto Terrace is a standout opportunity.\r\n\r\nEnquire today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nProperty documents:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FJM4",
